{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_01A9F0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"前往下一个目的地时，途中有一段要沿原路折返。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"别因为已经熟悉地形就大意。敌人已经知道你的存在，警戒应该比之前更严了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":"AUX_FORCE_EXPANSION_IGNORED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"谨慎前进。有必要的话，也别犹豫使用火器。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"AUX_POLARITY_NUANCE_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"看来得过河了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"对。有一座吊桥。这里就这一条路，要避开敌人的视线恐怕得动点脑筋。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":96,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"过了吊桥，再穿过沼泽……前面是香蕉种植园吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":66,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"看起来还附带有工厂设施。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"这里和森林里走起来应该很不一样，小心点。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"明白。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":9,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"另外，途中也可能发现<R=FSLN,桑地诺民族解放阵线>的俘虏。尽可能用富尔顿把他们回收回来。","cn_control_tokens":"<R=FSLN,桑地诺民族解放阵线>","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":"AUX_PARTIAL_JPN_DETAIL_RESTORED; RUBY_LOCALIZED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"我会记住。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""}]}